></ruby><seg source="#source-11792-11795">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11795-11810"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11810-11813">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11813-11825"><rb>演</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11825-11828">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11828-11849"><rb>仕事</rb><rt>しごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11849-11866">なんです。</seg></p>
