      <p><seg source="#source-12883-12886">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12886-12913"><rb>串戲</rb><rt>じようだん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12913-12925"><rb>言</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12925-12934">つちや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12934-12946"><rb>可</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12946-12970">けません。あれを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12970-12982"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12982-12988">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12988-13000"><rb>來</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13000-13021">ようものなら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13021-13036"><rb>河</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13036-13039">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13039-13051"><rb>落</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13051-13063">つこつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13063-13078"><rb>了</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby>つたんです。」と、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13105-13126"><rb>無論</rb><rt>むろん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13126-13141"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13141-13144">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13144-13171"><rb>俥代</rb><rt>くるまだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13171-13174">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13174-13189"><rb>拂</rb><rt>はら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13189-13198">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13198-13216"><rb>俥</rb><rt>くるま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13216-13219">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13219-13234"><rb>家</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13234-13240">まで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13240-13252"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13252-13258">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source