      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15474-15489"><rb>茲</rb><rt>こゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15489-15492">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15492-15507"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15507-15525">きいちやんと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15525-15540"><rb>稱</rb><rt>とな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15540-15558">へて、もと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15558-15576"><rb>其處</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15576-15579">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15579-15594"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15594-15597">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15597-15630"><rb>内藝妓</rb><rt>うちげいしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15630-15639">をして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15639-15651"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15651-15669">たのがある。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15669-15684"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15684-15687">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15687-15708"><rb>堅氣</rb><rt>かたぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15708-15714">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15714-15735"><rb>手傳</rb><rt>てつだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15735-15741">ひに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15741-15753"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15753-15756">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15756-15768"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15768-15776">る。</seg></p>
